<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Rentsure Holdings yr shr, div jump.</title>
<headline>Rentsure Holdings yr shr, div jump.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended 30 June 1996</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     236.5	 vs   111.3</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		  60.0	 vs    25.0</p>
<p>    Attrib earnings	 12.95	 vs    8.17</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   19.10	 vs   11.51</p>
<p>    Tax			  1.15	 vs    0.79</p>
<p>    Turnover		 183.38	 vs  143.36</p>
<p>Div payable October 31</p>
<p>on register October 18</p>
<p>Full name: Rentsure Holdings Limited from Rentmeesterbeleggings Limited. (finance)</p>
<p>NOTE - The group said the focused sales of packaged assurance plans in the predominantly affordable markets by Rentmeester Assurance and the company's relatively low issuing cost structure of this type of business should ensure further strong growth in the year ahead.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
